{"4485020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Crimson Hunt","steam_appid":4485020,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where old legends have been forgotten, the hunter Victoria works in the shadows, eliminating the last remnants of the vampire bloodlines.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, she receives a new mission: infiltrate a secluded Victorian mansion deep in the woods and rescue a young woman named Eleanor, kidnapped by an ancient vampire who has awakened once more. Upon arrival, Victoria discovers the mansion is far more than a simple refuge — it is a sanctuary of darkness, infested with vampires, ghouls, and bloodthirsty creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor, weakened but determined, manages to escape her cell and crosses paths with Victoria, forming a fragile and uneasy alliance. Together, they must survive, push through decaying corridors, solve ancient mechanisms, and confront the horrors lurking in every corner.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore oppressive environments, solve environmental puzzles, and carefully manage your resources: ammunition is scarce, light is vital, and every encounter matters. Combine a variety of weapons and tools to adapt to unpredictable enemies, or team up in local split-screen co-op to face the horror together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Cooperate. Uncover the truth.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modernized Classic Survival Horror<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark, oppressive environments where danger may hide around every corner. Constant tension and vulnerability are at the heart of the experience.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Combat<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face grotesque creatures using a variety of weapons and tools. Every enemy encounter demands strategy, positioning, and steady nerves.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character-Driven Narrative<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story centered on the evolving relationship between its protagonists, where choices, the past, and emotional tension grow alongside the danger.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Split-Screen Co-op<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full journey with another player. Coordinate strategies, share resources, and face the horror as a team.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment-Driven Puzzles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and mechanical puzzles to progress. Observation, logic, and exploration are essential.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is limited, healing is scarce, and every item counts. Smart inventory management can mean the difference between life and death.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where old legends have been forgotten, the hunter Victoria works in the shadows, eliminating the last remnants of the vampire bloodlines.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, she receives a new mission: infiltrate a secluded Victorian mansion deep in the woods and rescue a young woman named Eleanor, kidnapped by an ancient vampire who has awakened once more. Upon arrival, Victoria discovers the mansion is far more than a simple refuge — it is a sanctuary of darkness, infested with vampires, ghouls, and bloodthirsty creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor, weakened but determined, manages to escape her cell and crosses paths with Victoria, forming a fragile and uneasy alliance. Together, they must survive, push through decaying corridors, solve ancient mechanisms, and confront the horrors lurking in every corner.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore oppressive environments, solve environmental puzzles, and carefully manage your resources: ammunition is scarce, light is vital, and every encounter matters. Combine a variety of weapons and tools to adapt to unpredictable enemies, or team up in local split-screen co-op to face the horror together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Cooperate. Uncover the truth.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modernized Classic Survival Horror<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark, oppressive environments where danger may hide around every corner. Constant tension and vulnerability are at the heart of the experience.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Combat<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face grotesque creatures using a variety of weapons and tools. Every enemy encounter demands strategy, positioning, and steady nerves.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character-Driven Narrative<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story centered on the evolving relationship between its protagonists, where choices, the past, and emotional tension grow alongside the danger.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Split-Screen Co-op<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full journey with another player. Coordinate strategies, share resources, and face the horror as a team.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment-Driven Puzzles<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental and mechanical puzzles to progress. Observation, logic, and exploration are essential.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammunition is limited, healing is scarce, and every item counts. Smart inventory management can mean the difference between life and death.<\/p>","short_description":"You play as Victoria, a vampire hunter haunted by her past, and Eleanor, a young woman trapped in a nightmare that has only just begun. Together, they must endure grotesque creatures, hidden traps, and a presence that seems to know them better than they realize.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, German, Turkish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4485020\/8ae6fc94c17ee28b53feca959a13d3ce32364ca0\/header.jpg?t=1793757156","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4485020\/e4a4d68f6f5c7f4e11f7a2c635be0c8767df5cff\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793757156","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4485020\/e4a4d68f6f5c7f4e11f7a2c635be0c8767df5cff\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793757156","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon™ RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel® Core™ i7-10510 or AMD Ryzen™ 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® RTX 3060TI or AMD Radeon™ RX 5700<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"All rights reserved.","developers":["Farelas"],"publishers":["Farelas"],"demos":[{"appid":4662870,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1199,"final":1199,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$11.99"},"packages":[1565108],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy The Crimson Hunt","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1565108,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"The Crimson Hunt - $11.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1199}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":39,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen Co-op"},{"id":24,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4485020\/de1f50e7ac983c3307a573fbb45c10b046574525\/ss_de1f50e7ac983c3307a573fbb45c1